# TEC PCN blockframes

Low-fidelity **blockframes** for the TEC PCN (`TEC`) case view: grey page frames and text bars for journey boards. Not screenshots and not Mermaid — page-shaped wireframes that stay editable in git.

Each frame is labelled with the screen or view name. Hover any grey block for the element it represents. Use `bf-text--callout` (or `callout: true` on text partials) for GOV.UK black heading/copy, and `bf-action--callout` on links/actions for GOV.UK link blue. Reuse the primitives when adding Batch or Exception journeys later.

