<div class="bf-journey__step"><%= partial "partials/blockframe/views/tec_pcn_case_details", locals: { caption: "3. TEC PCN — Case details" } %><p class="bf-journey__note">After continue, the clerk returns to Case details. The Application section shows the updated TE9 values.</p></div>
</div>

