## Forms and events

Event screens without case tabs. The short line under the form title shows the case number.

The showcase frame below includes one control for each CCD field type used on events in this POC (`Text`, `TextArea`, `Email`, `Number`, `MoneyGBP`, `Date`, `DateTime`, `FixedList`, `FixedRadioList`, `MultiSelectList`, `Document`, `Label`). Labels match real event fields where practical (`Email` → **Submitter email**; `DateTime` → **Email received at**). The full SDK catalogue (including types not used here) is on [ExUI form elements](/exui-form-elements.html).

