## Examples

### Minimal

Same Tasks shell as the catalogue, but only **Manage cases**, the **case number**, and the **Validate OOT application** task card have visible text. Everything else is empty bars with varied widths. All elements in that task card use callout styling.

The Case list frame mirrors ExUI `/cases`: **Case list** heading, **Hide Filter**, then a split with work-basket **filters** (heading + Apply/Reset, full-width fields, Back to top) on the left and **Your cases** (result count + table) on the right. The wide version uses a 6-column table (Case Number, PCN, local authority, respondent details 1, VRN, **State** at the far right); the compact version below matches the standard frame width with a 4-column table ending in **State**. Callouts: Manage cases, Case list, Filters, Case type (`TEC PCN`), Your cases, and Case Number (column + one row). Find case **search** results (not shown here) also include a **State** column after Case Number for `TEC`, `TEC_BATCH`, and `TEC_EXCEPTION`.

