<%= partial "partials/blockframe/views/tec_pcn_tasks_minimal" %>
<%= partial "partials/blockframe/views/tec_cases_list_minimal" %>
</div>

<div class="bf-catalogue">
<%= partial "partials/blockframe/views/tec_cases_list_minimal", locals: { compact: true } %>
</div>

### My work

Mirrors ExUI **My work** → **My tasks**: **My work** heading, intro line, HMCTS sub-nav (**My tasks** active | Available tasks), then the task table. Columns match the live screen — Case reference, Case name, Case category, Location, Task, Date, and Manage. The compact version below uses four columns. Callouts: Manage cases, My work, My tasks, Case reference (column), Task (column + Validate OOT application), and TODAY. Case references and Manage are link-styled.

